WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Back heavy punch reaches the airborne opponent and scores a counter hit.

2
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.420
Dhalsim activates Drive Rush beneath the launched opponent.

3
00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:01.800
Back medium punch catches the opponent after Drive Rush.

4
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.550
Heavy Yoga Blast connects underneath the airborne opponent.

5
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:03.440
Crouching heavy kick slides into the falling opponent to finish the conversion.
